# Firebase Cloud Messaging (web push). Optional - when unset the push feature
# is reported as "not configured" and the rest of the app works normally.
# Prefer these env vars in production (e.g. Vercel) over the local
# incident-management-firebase.json service-account file (which is gitignored).
# FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY may contain literal \n escapes; they are normalised on load.
